From: =?UTF-8?q?=D0=92=D0=B8=D0=BA=D1=82=D0=BE=D1=80=20=D0=96=D1=83=D1=80?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=D0=BE=D0=BC=D1=81=D0=BA=D0=B8=D0=B9?= <git@igrnt.info>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 11:14:10 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1171/1259] HERESY 1167: the last touches before rc1: the veil
 always the night's, with OSEM; she a little higher, the tall bar 98 px; the
 cards fainter; the rooms in capitals
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor, the morning of 06.10.2026:
· «давай LOADING только в ночной моей всегда… И Дева чёткая… вдруг не опознается тёмный режим»: the veil wears Scroll by
  Lamplight whatever the page's theme (the night theme's own attribute on the veil), her cloud the night's black at 0.45;
  no grey before the page knows its theme, no flash in a dark room.
· «И не хочешь добавить слоган OSEM?»: «OSEM (say it: awesome) · Open Source, Engaged & Musical» on the veil under the logo,
  in English in every language (the pun is English).
· «Деву вверх… пусть слова проседают вниз. И отступ логотипа уменьши при высоком баре… Смотри как честно… 4pt так
  четыре»: she and her cloud 11 units higher (about 4 px in the tall bar: as far as her wingtips stay inside the window),
  the words where they were; the tall bar 105 → 98 px.
· «карточки треков сделай ещё светлее, чтобы не краснили сильно. Поубавь на 10-20% альфа слой»: the Librarian cards' washes
  of the accent 15 % fainter (4 / 8 / 14 % → 3.4 / 6.8 / 11.9 %), the page's own tones untouched.
· «либо кегль на 2pt крупнее, либо все имена комнат — в CAPS»: the rooms' names in capitals, spaced .08em, as STUDIO.

cdp-console 340/0/7 (the tall bar's 98 px in its checks), check-i18n 14/0, check-player 3/0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/app.css    | 21 ++++++++++++++++-----
 tools/console/index.html | 12 +++++++-----
 2 files changed, 23 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/console/app.css b/tools/console/app.css
index 9031542..527fb35 100644
--- a/tools/console/app.css
+++ b/tools/console/app.css
@@ -2017,6 +2017,8 @@ html.hz-open { overflow: hidden; }
 .tabs button { padding: 5px 16px; border: 0; border-radius: calc(var(--r-md) - 2px); background: none; color: var(--muted);
   font: 500 13px/1.3 var(--sans); cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; }   /* 1148: a room's name on one line */
 .tabs button:hover { color: var(--ink); }
+/* HERESY 1167 (Viktor: «либо кегль на 2pt крупнее, либо все имена комнат — в CAPS»): capitals, spaced, as the logo's STUDIO */
+.tabs button { text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; font-weight: 600; }
 .tabs button.is-active { background: var(--raise); color: var(--ink); box-shadow: 0 1px 2px var(--shadow-lg, rgba(0,0,0,.15)); }
 /* Write and Post take the place of the form and the take; the takes list stays */
 .write-col, .post-col { grid-column: 1 / span 2; }
@@ -3302,10 +3304,14 @@ input[type="checkbox"], input[type="radio"] { accent-color: var(--check, var(--a
 /* the player: a tone from the top, the glass kept */
 #playbar { background: linear-gradient(180deg, color-mix(in oklab, var(--tone-2) 85%, transparent), color-mix(in oklab, var(--panel) 85%, transparent)); }   /* HERESY 1167: 15 % see-through (it was 20) */
 /* the Librarian's cards: a breath of the accent at the top; deeper when hovered, checked, playing */
-.coll-card { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--tone-1), var(--panel) 70%); }
-.coll-card:hover { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--tone-2), var(--tone-1)); }
-.coll-card.is-sel { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--tone-3), var(--tone-1)); }
-.coll-card.is-current { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--tone-2), var(--panel) 80%); }
+/* HERESY 1167 (Viktor: «карточки треков сделай ещё светлее, чтобы не краснили сильно. Поубавь на 10-20% альфа слой»): the
+   cards' own washes, 15 % fainter than the page's tones (4 / 8 / 14 % → 3.4 / 6.8 / 11.9 %) */
+.coll-card { --card-1: color-mix(in oklab, var(--amber) 3.4%, var(--panel)); --card-2: color-mix(in oklab, var(--amber) 6.8%, var(--panel));
+  --card-3: color-mix(in oklab, var(--amber) 11.9%, var(--panel)); }
+.coll-card { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--card-1), var(--panel) 70%); }
+.coll-card:hover { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--card-2), var(--card-1)); }
+.coll-card.is-sel { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--card-3), var(--card-1)); }
+.coll-card.is-current { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--card-2), var(--panel) 80%); }
 #playbar .pb-cover { box-shadow: 0 4px 12px -6px var(--shadow-lg, rgba(0,0,0,.35)), inset 0 0 0 1px color-mix(in oklab, var(--ink) 8%, transparent); }
 .coll-pin { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--tone-3), var(--tone-1)); }
 /* drawers: the summary a shade above the body */
@@ -3835,7 +3841,7 @@ body[data-tab="post"] .lib-refined { display: inline-flex; }
      A calmer page (html[data-motion="reduced"]) cuts it to nothing with every other transition. */
 @property --bar-h { syntax: "<length>"; inherits: true; initial-value: 52px; }
 :root { --bar-h: 52px; }
-@media (min-width: 1660px) { body.bar-tall { --bar-h: 105px; } }
+@media (min-width: 1660px) { body.bar-tall { --bar-h: 98px; } }   /* HERESY 1167: 105 → 98 (Viktor: «отступ логотипа уменьши при высоком баре») */
 body { transition: --bar-h .22s ease; }
 @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { body { transition: none; } }
 /* · the cheat-sheet's lead paragraph across the sheet («убери ручные переносы строк. Пусть всё автоврепом идёт») */
@@ -3878,6 +3884,11 @@ html.booting .boot-veil {
   background: var(--ground); color: var(--ink); transition: opacity .5s ease;
 }
 html.booting.veil-lift .boot-veil { opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }
+/* HERESY 1167: the veil is the night's (data-theme on it); her cloud as the night has it, whatever the page's tone */
+.boot-veil { --logo-cloud: #000; --logo-cloud-alpha: .45; }
+.boot-osem { margin: -8px 0 0; font: 400 clamp(12px, .95vw, 16px)/1.4 var(--sans); letter-spacing: .06em; color: var(--dim);
+  text-align: center; animation: boot-in 1.1s .15s ease both; }
+.boot-osem b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .18em; }
 html.i18n-wait .boot-veil > * { visibility: hidden; }
 .boot-logo { width: min(86vw, 1100px); animation: boot-in 1.1s ease both; }
 .boot-mark { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; overflow: visible; }
diff --git a/tools/console/index.html b/tools/console/index.html
index f19bd99..e816bb1 100644
--- a/tools/console/index.html
+++ b/tools/console/index.html
@@ -32,8 +32,10 @@
      stands ready and seven seconds have passed since the navigation (Viktor: «Давай 7. Это стоит того»); a click or a key lifts it sooner, once the page is ready;
      seventeen seconds lift it whatever happens. The logo is the bar's own (copied in under the top bar, its words in the page's
      language once the translation runs). Not for a test browser (navigator.webdriver), ?scope=claude or ?noveil. -->
-<div class="boot-veil" id="bootVeil" role="status">
+<!-- HERESY 1167 (Viktor: «давай LOADING только в ночной моей всегда»): the veil wears the night theme whatever the page's -->
+<div class="boot-veil" id="bootVeil" role="status" data-theme="igr-night">
   <div class="boot-logo" id="bootLogo"></div>
+  <p class="boot-osem" translate="no"><b>OSEM</b> <i>(say it: awesome)</i> · Open Source, Engaged &amp; Musical</p>
   <p class="boot-words">Loading the Sound Heresy</p>
   <div class="boot-line" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
 </div>
